  "ID": "66179",
  "post_title": "Los más de 100 litros/m2 llovidos en Alcudia de Veo llenan el pantano de Benitandús",
  "post_date": "2016-12-18 22:08:29",
  "post_name": "los-mas-de-100-litrosm2-llovidos-en-alcudia-de-veo-llenan-el-pantano-de-benitandus",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Medio ambiente|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_4690.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">(40 fotos) Los m&aacute;s de 100 l/m2 ca&iacute;dos en Alcudia de Veo en las lluvias delos &uacute;ltimos d&iacute;as han llenado el pantano de Benitand&uacute;s, que poco a poco va desaguando al r&iacute;o Veo. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_4810.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">El r&iacute;o Sonella sigue con buen caudal de agua en su cauce en Onda. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/RioVillahermosaEnArgelita5.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">Tambi&eacute;n va caudaloso el r&iacute;o Villahermosa en Argeltia. La lluvia ha impedido el desarrollo normal del Suera: Un poble al carrer.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4662.jpg\" alt=\"img_4662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4663.jpg\" alt=\"img_4663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4665.jpg\" alt=\"img_4665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4667.jpg\" alt=\"img_4667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4668.jpg\" alt=\"img_4668\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4670.jpg\" alt=\"img_4670\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4671.jpg\" alt=\"img_4671\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4674.jpg\" alt=\"img_4674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4676.jpg\" alt=\"img_4676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4677.jpg\" alt=\"img_4677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4679.jpg\" alt=\"img_4679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4680.jpg\" alt=\"img_4680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4682.jpg\" alt=\"img_4682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4684.jpg\" alt=\"img_4684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4686.jpg\" alt=\"img_4686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pantabenitandusriusonelladiumenge181216/img_4688.jpg\" alt=\"img_4688\" style=\"ma